---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const pageTitle = 'Veterinary Mycology Group · ULPGC';
const pageDescription = 'Research group in veterinary mycology at the Faculty of Veterinary Medicine, Universidad de Las Palmas de Gran Canaria.';
---

<BaseLayout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription} lang="en">
  <main id="main-content" class="home-main">
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>VETERINARY MYCOLOGY GROUP</h1>
      <p class="hero-affiliation">Faculty of Veterinary Medicine · Universidad de Las Palmas de Gran Canaria</p>
    </section>

    <section class="institutional-logos">
      <img src="/images/logos/ulpgc_color.png" alt="Universidad de Las Palmas de Gran Canaria" />
      <img src="/images/logos/iusa.png" alt="Instituto Universitario de Sanidad Animal y Seguridad Alimentaria" />
    </section>

    <section class="intro">
      <p>We study fungal diseases in domestic animals, reptiles, and fish. Our work integrates clinical mycological diagnosis with research into the epidemiology, pathogenesis, and treatment of the main veterinary mycoses.</p>
      <p>The group is led by <a href="/docs/cv-begona-acosta.pdf">Dr. Begoña Acosta Hernández</a> and is part of the University Institute for Animal Health and Food Safety (IUSA) at ULPGC.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="nav-cards" aria-label="Main sections">
      <a href="/en/micologia/generalidades/" class="nav-card">
        <h2>Mycology</h2>
        <p>Biology and general characteristics of fungal pathogens of veterinary interest.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/en/patologias/levaduras/" class="nav-card">
        <h2>Pathologies</h2>
        <p>Candidiasis, cryptococcosis, aspergillosis and other mycoses in domestic and wild animals.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/en/laboratorio/" class="nav-card">
        <h2>Laboratory</h2>
        <p>Mycological diagnostic protocols and techniques used in the group's laboratory.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/en/investigacion/articulos-congresos/" class="nav-card">
        <h2>Research</h2>
        <p>Scientific publications, conference communications, and reference articles.</p>
      </a>
    </section>

    <section class="photo-strip">
      <img src="/images/home/microscopy-1.jpg" alt="Scientific photograph of the veterinary mycology research group" />
      <img src="/images/home/culture-2.jpg" alt="Fungal culture in the veterinary mycology laboratory" />
      <img src="/images/home/pathology-3.jpg" alt="Pathology caused by fungi in animals" />
    </section>

    <p class="visually-hidden" lang="en">Veterinary Mycology Group — ULPGC</p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .home-main {
    max-width: 1024px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-3xl) var(--space-lg);
  }

  .hero {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
    }
  }

  .hero-affiliation {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--font-size-body);
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .institutional-logos {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    margin: var(--space-xl) 0;
  }

  .institutional-logos img {
    max-height: 80px;
    width: auto;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 740px;
    margin: var(--space-2xl) auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .intro p {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .intro a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .nav-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-md);
    margin: var(--space-2xl) 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .nav-cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .nav-card {
    display: block;
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--color-text);
    background: var(--color-surface-subtle);
    transition: border-color 0.15s, background 0.15s;
  }

  .nav-card:hover,
  .nav-card:focus-visible {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    background: #f0f7f4;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .nav-card h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: var(--font-size-h2);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-sm) 0;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .nav-card p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .photo-strip {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .photo-strip img {
    flex: 1;
    max-width: 33%;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: cover;
    aspect-ratio: 4/3;
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .photo-strip {
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .photo-strip img {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }

  .visually-hidden {
    position: absolute;
    left: -9999px;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
</style>
